# secrets & local data
# B-Minor #3: .dockerignore already excludes config.yaml and .env.* (a real
# event's own config can carry private source URLs with credentials, Ruling
# 29) -- keep git in sync so `git add -A` can't sweep either in by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.yaml
data/
samples/long/
